        "sw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pia inakubali \\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export na https://server/path (WebDAV). Folda baada ya jina la folda ya mtandao huiwekea Vespertine kikomo kwenye folda hiyo."
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export மற்றும் https://server/path (WebDAV) ஆகியவற்றையும் ஏற்கும். பகிர்வுப் பெயருக்குப் பின் உள்ள கோப்புறை, Vespertine-ஐ அந்தக் கோப்புறைக்கு மட்டும் வரம்பிடும்."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export మరియు https://server/path (WebDAV)ను కూడా అంగీకరిస్తుంది. షేర్ పేరు తర్వాత ఫోల్డర్ ఇస్తే Vespertine ఆ ఫోల్డర్‌కే పరిమితమవుతుంది."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "รองรับ \\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export และ https://server/path (WebDAV) ด้วย โฟลเดอร์ที่ต่อท้ายชื่อแชร์จะจำกัด Vespertine ไว้เฉพาะโฟลเดอร์นั้น"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\\\\\\\sunucu\\\\paylasim, nfs://sunucu/export ve https://sunucu/yol (WebDAV) biçimleri de kabul edilir. Paylaşım adından sonra gelen bir klasör, Vespertine’i o klasörle sınırlar."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Також підтримуються \\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export і https://server/path (WebDAV). Папка після назви ресурсу обмежує Vespertine лише цією папкою."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⁦\\\\\\\\server\\\\share⁩، nfs://server/export اور https://server/path (WebDAV) بھی قبول ہیں۔ شیئر کے نام کے بعد کوئی فولڈر Vespertine کو اسی فولڈر تک محدود کر دیتا ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cũng chấp nhận \\\\\\\\server\\\\share, nfs://server/export và https://server/path (WebDAV). Thư mục đứng sau tên chia sẻ sẽ giới hạn Vespertine trong thư mục đó."
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亦接受 \\\\\\\\server\\\\share、nfs://server/export 和 https://server/path（WebDAV）。在共享名稱後加上資料夾，可將 Vespertine 限制在該資料夾內。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也支持 \\\\\\\\server\\\\share、nfs://server/export 和 https://server/path（WebDAV）。在共享名称后添加文件夹，可将 Vespertine 限制在该文件夹内。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也接受 \\\\\\\\server\\\\share、nfs://server/export 和 https://server/path（WebDAV）。在共享名稱後加上檔案夾，可將 Vespertine 限制在該檔案夾內。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also correct existing tags when MusicBrainz is certain": {
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
