    "May trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy.": {
      "comment": "Visualizer: help for the beat strobe option.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kann bei Menschen mit fotosensitiver Epilepsie Anfälle auslösen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
