    "Over Bluetooth, AirPods Max receive AAC, which is lossy. Connect the USB-C cable for lossless 24-bit / 48 kHz.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "በBluetooth፣ AirPods Max ኪሳራ ያለውን AAC ይቀበላሉ። ለኪሳራ አልባ 24-bit / 48 kHz የUSB-C ገመዱን ያገናኙ።"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عبر Bluetooth، تستقبل AirPods Max صوت AAC، وهو مع فقد. صِل كبل USB-C للحصول على صوت بلا فقد بدقة 24 بت / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth-এ AirPods Max AAC পায়, যা লসি। লসলেস 24-bit / 48 kHz-এর জন্য USB-C কেবল যুক্ত করুন।"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Přes Bluetooth přijímají AirPods Max ztrátový AAC. Pro bezeztrátový zvuk 24 bitů / 48 kHz připojte kabel USB-C."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Via Bluetooth modtager AirPods Max AAC, som er tabsgivende. Tilslut USB-C-kablet for tabsfri 24-bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über Bluetooth empfangen AirPods Max AAC, das verlustbehaftet ist. Schließe das USB-C-Kabel an, um verlustfrei 24 Bit / 48 kHz zu erhalten."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Μέσω Bluetooth, τα AirPods Max λαμβάνουν AAC, που είναι με απώλειες. Συνδέστε το καλώδιο USB-C για ήχο χωρίς απώλειες 24 bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over Bluetooth, AirPods Max receive AAC, which is lossy. Connect the USB-C cable for lossless 24-bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por Bluetooth, los AirPods Max reciben AAC, que es un formato con pérdida. Conecta el cable USB-C para obtener audio sin pérdida de 24 bits / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods Max از طریق بلوتوث AAC دریافت می‌کند که بااتلاف است. برای صدای بی‌اتلاف ۲۴ بیتی / ۴۸ kHz کابل USB-C را وصل کنید."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetoothin kautta AirPods Max vastaanottaa AAC:tä, joka on häviöllinen. Liitä USB-C-kaapeli, niin saat häviöttömän 24-bit / 48 kHz -äänen."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa Bluetooth, AAC ang natatanggap ng AirPods Max, na lossy. Ikonekta ang USB-C cable para sa lossless na 24-bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Bluetooth, les AirPods Max reçoivent de l’AAC, un format avec perte. Branchez le câble USB-C pour du 24 bits / 48 kHz sans perte."
          }
        },
        "gu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth પર AirPods Max ને AAC મળે છે, જે લૉસી છે. લૉસલેસ 24-bit / 48 kHz માટે USB-C કેબલ જોડો."
          }
        },
        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta Bluetooth, AirPods Max suna karɓar AAC, wanda ke da asara. Haɗa kebul na USB-C don bit 24 / 48 kHz marar asara."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "דרך Bluetooth, AirPods Max מקבלות AAC, שהוא מאבד נתונים. חבר את כבל ה־USB-C לשמע ללא איבוד נתונים ב־24 סיביות / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth पर AirPods Max को AAC मिलता है, जो लॉसी है। लॉसलेस 24-bit / 48 kHz के लिए USB-C केबल जोड़ें।"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth-on az AirPods Max veszteséges AAC-t kap. A veszteségmentes 24 bit / 48 kHz-hez csatlakoztassa az USB-C-kábelt."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melalui Bluetooth, AirPods Max menerima AAC, yang bersifat lossy. Hubungkan kabel USB-C untuk 24-bit / 48 kHz lossless."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Via Bluetooth, AirPods Max ricevono AAC, che è lossy. Collega il cavo USB-C per l’audio lossless a 24 bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth経由では、AirPods Maxはロッシー形式のAACを受信します。ロスレスの24ビット / 48 kHzにするには、USB-Cケーブルを接続してください。"
          }
        },
        "kn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth ಮೂಲಕ AirPods Max ಲಾಸಿಯಾದ AAC ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸುತ್ತವೆ. ಲಾಸ್‌ಲೆಸ್ 24-bit / 48 kHz ಗಾಗಿ USB-C ಕೇಬಲ್ ಸಂಪರ್ಕಿಸಿ."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth를 통해서는 AirPods Max가 손실 압축 방식인 AAC를 수신합니다. 무손실 24비트 / 48 kHz를 사용하려면 USB-C 케이블을 연결하십시오."
          }
        },
        "ml": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth വഴി AirPods Max-ന് ലഭിക്കുന്നത് AAC ആണ്, അത് ലോസിയാണ്. ലോസ്‌ലെസ് 24-bit / 48 kHz-നായി USB-C കേബിൾ കണക്റ്റ് ചെയ്യുക."
          }
        },
        "mr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth वरून AirPods Max ला AAC मिळतो, जो लॉसी आहे. लॉसलेस 24-bit / 48 kHz साठी USB-C केबल जोडा."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melalui Bluetooth, AirPods Max menerima AAC, yang berkehilangan. Sambungkan kabel USB-C untuk 24-bit / 48 kHz tanpa kehilangan."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Via Bluetooth mottar AirPods Max AAC, som er tapsbasert. Koble til USB-C-kabelen for tapsfri 24-bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Via Bluetooth ontvangen AirPods Max AAC, wat lossy is. Sluit de USB-C-kabel aan voor lossless 24 bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "pa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth ਰਾਹੀਂ AirPods Max ਨੂੰ AAC ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ, ਜੋ ਲੌਸੀ ਹੈ। ਲੌਸਲੈੱਸ 24-bit / 48 kHz ਲਈ USB-C ਕੇਬਲ ਜੋੜੋ।"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przez Bluetooth AirPods Max odbierają AAC, który jest stratny. Podłącz kabel USB-C, aby uzyskać bezstratny dźwięk 24-bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por Bluetooth, os AirPods Max recebem AAC, que é com perdas. Conecte o cabo USB-C para áudio sem perdas de 24 bits / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por Bluetooth, os AirPods Max recebem AAC, que é com perdas. Ligue o cabo USB-C para áudio sem perdas a 24 bits / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prin Bluetooth, AirPods Max primesc AAC, care este cu pierderi. Conectați cablul USB-C pentru audio fără pierderi la 24 de biți / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Via Bluetooth tar AirPods Max emot AAC, som är med förlust. Anslut USB-C-kabeln för förlustfritt 24 bitar/48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "sw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupitia Bluetooth, AirPods Max hupokea AAC, ambayo ina upotevu. Unganisha kebo ya USB-C kwa biti 24 / 48 kHz bila upotevu."
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth வழியாக AirPods Max இழப்புள்ள AAC-ஐப் பெறும். இழப்பற்ற 24-bit / 48 kHz-க்கு USB-C கேபிளை இணைக்கவும்."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth ద్వారా AirPods Max లాసీ అయిన AACని అందుకుంటాయి. లాస్‌లెస్ 24-bit / 48 kHz కోసం USB-C కేబుల్‌ను కనెక్ట్ చేయండి."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ผ่าน Bluetooth AirPods Max จะได้รับ AAC ซึ่งสูญเสียข้อมูล เชื่อมต่อสาย USB-C เพื่อรับเสียงแบบไม่สูญเสียข้อมูล 24-bit / 48 kHz"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods Max, Bluetooth üzerinden kayıplı olan AAC alır. Kayıpsız 24 bit / 48 kHz için USB-C kablosunu bağlayın."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Через Bluetooth AirPods Max отримують AAC — формат із втратами. Під’єднайте кабель USB-C, щоб отримати 24-бітний звук 48 kHz без втрат."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بلوٹوتھ پر AirPods Max کو AAC ملتا ہے، جو لاسی ہے۔ لاس لیس 24-bit / 48 kHz کے لیے USB-C کیبل لگائیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qua Bluetooth, AirPods Max nhận AAC, một định dạng có tổn hao. Hãy kết nối cáp USB-C để có âm thanh không tổn hao 24 bit / 48 kHz."
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "經藍牙連接時，AirPods Max 接收的是有損的 AAC。連接 USB-C 線即可獲得無損 24 位元／48 kHz 音訊。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过蓝牙连接时，AirPods Max 接收的是有损的 AAC。连接 USB-C 线缆即可获得无损 24 位 / 48 kHz。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過藍牙連接時，AirPods Max 接收的是有損的 AAC。連接 USB-C 連接線即可取得無損 24 位元／48 kHz。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
