    "Saved in Vespertine's library; the files aren't changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "በVespertine ቤተ-መጻሕፍት ውስጥ ተቀምጧል፤ ፋይሎቹ አይቀየሩም"
