    "Tag edits are written to the files on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "የመለያ ማስተካከያዎች በአገልጋዩ ላይ ባሉ ፋይሎች ላይ ይጻፋሉ።"
