    "The measurement has too few points to design filters from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "መለኪያው ማጣሪያዎችን ለመንደፍ በጣም ጥቂት ነጥቦች አሉት።"
