    "Line %lld gives a delay in samples. Give it in milliseconds (ms), which work at every sample rate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "am": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "መስመር %lld መዘግየትን በናሙናዎች ይሰጣል። በማንኛውም የናሙና ፍጥነት በሚሰሩ ሚሊሰከንዶች (ms) ይስጡት።"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحدد السطر %lld تأخيرًا بالعينات. حدّده بالمللي ثانية (ms)، فهي تعمل مع أي معدل عينة."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "লাইন %lld স্যাম্পলে একটি ডিলে দিয়েছে। এটি মিলিসেকেন্ডে (ms) দিন, যা প্রতিটি স্যাম্পল রেটে কাজ করে।"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Řádek %lld uvádí zpoždění ve vzorcích. Zadejte ho v milisekundách (ms), které fungují při každé vzorkovací frekvenci."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linje %lld angiver en forsinkelse i samples. Angiv den i millisekunder (ms), som virker ved alle samplingfrekvenser."
